0 hover:bg-muted-beige/60 hover:text-obsidian" href="/terms">Terms of Service</a></li><li class="shrink-0"><a class="block whitespace-nowrap rounded-full border px-3 py-2 text-sm transition lg:rounded-lg lg:border-0 lg:px-3 lg:py-2 border-obsidian/15 text-obsidian/70 hover:bg-muted-beige/60 hover:text-obsidian" href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a></li><li class="shrink-0"><a class="block whitespace-nowrap rounded-full border px-3 py-2 text-sm transition lg:rounded-lg lg:border-0 lg:px-3 lg:py-2 border-obsidian/15 text-obsidian/70 hover:bg-muted-beige/60 hover:text-obsidian" href="/cookies">Cookie Policy</a></li><li class="shrink-0"><a class="block whitespace-nowrap rounded-full border px-3 py-2 text-sm transition lg:rounded-lg lg:border-0 lg:px-3 lg:py-2 border-obsidian/15 text-obsidian/70 hover:bg-muted-beige/60 hover:text-obsidian" href="/acceptable-use">Acceptable Use</a></li><li class="shrink-0"><a aria-current="page" class="block whitespace-nowrap rounded-full border px-3 py-2 text-sm transition lg:rounded-lg lg:border-0 lg:px-3 lg:py-2 border-obsidian bg-obsidian text-major lg:bg-emerald-accent lg:text-[#141412]" href="/copyright">Copyright &amp; Takedowns</a></li><li class="shrink-0"><a class="block whitespace-nowrap rounded-full border px-3 py-2 text-sm transition lg:rounded-lg lg:border-0 lg:px-3 lg:py-2 border-obsidian/15 text-obsidian/70 hover:bg-muted-beige/60 hover:text-obsidian" href="/subprocessors">Subprocessors</a></li><li class="shrink-0"><a class="block whitespace-nowrap rounded-full border px-3 py-2 text-sm transition lg:rounded-lg lg:border-0 lg:px-3 lg:py-2 border-obsidian/15 text-obsidian/70 hover:bg-muted-beige/60 hover:text-obsidian" href="/credits">Credits &amp; Licences</a></li></ul></nav><main id="main-content" class="min-w-0"><article class="max-w-3xl"><p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-obsidian/50">Effective <!-- -->30 September 2026</p><h1 class="mt-3 text-4xl font-bold leading-tight tracking-tight sm:text-5xl">Copyright &amp;<!-- --> <em class="text-obsidian/70">Takedowns</em></h1><div class="mt-5 text-lg leading-relaxed text-obsidian/75">We respect creators’ rights, including yours. Videos on <!-- -->Captionit<!-- --> are private to their owners, but if you believe content processed or stored with <!-- -->Captionit<!-- --> infringes your copyright, tell us and we will act quickly. This process follows the US DMCA and India’s IT Rules notice-and-takedown framework.</div><div class="mt-10 space-y-10"><section id="notice" class="scroll-mt-24"><h2 class="text-xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-2xl"><a href="#notice" class="hover:underline hover:decoration-orange-accent hover:decoration-2 hover:underline-offset-4">Sending a takedown notice</a></h2><div class="mt-3 space-y-3 leading-relaxed text-obsidian/80 [&amp;_a]:font-medium [&amp;_a]:underline [&amp;_a]:decoration-orange-accent [&amp;_a]:decoration-2 [&amp;_a]:underline-offset-4 [&amp;_li]:ml-5 [&amp;_li]:list-disc [&amp;_li]:pl-1 [&amp;_strong]:text-obsidian [&amp;_ul]:space-y-1.5"><p>Email <!-- -->work.techhacksai@gmail.com<!-- --> with the subject “Copyright notice” and include:</p><ul><li>your name, address, phone number and email;</li><li>a description of the copyrighted work;</li><li>where the infringing material is (a shared link or other details that let us find it);</li><li>a statement that you have a good-faith belief the use is not authorised by the owner, its agent or the law;</li><li>a statement, under penalty of perjury, that your notice is accurate and that you are the owner or authorised to act for them;</li><li>your physical or electronic signature.</li></ul></div></section><section id="counter" class="scroll-mt-24"><h2 class="text-xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-2xl"><a href="#counter" class="hover:underline hover:decoration-orange-accent hover:decoration-2 hover:underline-offset-4">Counter-notices</a></h2><div class="mt-3 space-y-3 leading-relaxed text-obsidian/80 [&amp;_a]:font-medium [&amp;_a]:underline [&amp;_a]:decoration-orange-accent [&amp;_a]:decoration-2 [&amp;_a]:underline-offset-4 [&amp;_li]:ml-5 [&amp;_li]:list-disc [&amp;_li]:pl-1 [&amp;_strong]:text-obsidian [&amp;_ul]:space-y-1.5"><p>If your content was removed and you believe that was a mistake or you have permission to use it, reply with a counter-notice including your contact details, what was removed, a statement under penalty of perjury that it was removed by mistake or misidentification, your consent to the jurisdiction of the relevant courts, and your signature. We forward it to the complainant and may restore the content unless they start legal action within the legal timeframe.</p></div></section><section id="repeat" class="scroll-mt-24"><h2 class="text-xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-2xl"><a href="#repeat" class="hover:underline hover:decoration-orange-accent hover:decoration-2 hover:underline-offset-4">Repeat infringers</a></h2><div class="mt-3 space-y-3 leading-relaxed text-obsidian/80 [&amp;_a]:font-medium [&amp;_a]:underline [&amp;_a]:decoration-orange-accent [&amp;_a]:decoration-2 [&amp;_a]:underline-offset-4 [&amp;_li]:ml-5 [&amp;_li]:list-disc [&amp;_li]:pl-1 [&amp;_strong]:text-obsidian [&amp;_ul]:space-y-1.5"><p>We close the accounts of users who repeatedly infringe others’ rights.</p></div></section><section id="false" class="scroll-mt-24"><h2 class="text-xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-2xl"><a href="#false" class="hover:underline hover:decoration-orange-accent hover:decoration-2 hover:underline-offset-4">Please be accurate</a></h2><div class="mt-3 space-y-3 leading-relaxed text-obsidian/80 [&amp;_a]:font-medium [&amp;_a]:underline [&amp;_a]:decoration-orange-accent [&amp;_a]:decoration-2 [&amp;_a]:underline-offset-4 [&amp;_li]:ml-5 [&amp;_li]:list-disc [&amp;_li]:pl-1 [&amp;_strong]:text-obsidian [&amp;_ul]:space-y-1.5"><p>Knowingly false notices or counter-notices can make you liable for damages. If you are not sure whether something infringes, consider getting legal advice first.</p></div></section></div><p class="mt-14 rounded-2xl border border-obsidian/10 bg-muted-beige/40 p-5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-obsidian/70">Questions about this document? Write to <strong class="text-obsidian">work.techhacksai@gmail.com</strong>. <!-- -->Parvez Achhan Ali Siddiqui, an individual (sole proprietor) trading as Captionit<!-- -->, <!-- -->India<!-- -->.</p></article><!--$--><!--/$--></main></div><footer class="relative overflow-hidden border-t border-[#FFFFEB]/10 bg-[#1E1E1B] pt-20 pb-10 text-[#FFFFEB]"><div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8"><div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-x-6 gap-y-10 md:grid-cols-4 lg:gap-16 pb-16"><div class="space-y-4"><h3 class="font-mono text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-[#FFFFEB]/50">Product</h3><ul class="space-y-0.5 text-sm text-[#FFFFEB]/75 lg:space-y-2.5"><li><a class="inline-flex min-h-10 items-center transition-colors hover:text-[#34D399] hover:underline underline-offset-4 lg:min-h-0" href="/#how">How it works</a></li><li><a class="inline-flex min-h-10 items-center transition-colors hover:text-[#34D399] hover:underline underline-offset-4 lg:min-h-0" href="/pricing">Pricing</a></li><li><a class="inline-flex min-h-10 items-center transition-colors hover:text-[#34D399] hover:underline underline-offset-4 lg:min-h-0" href="/auto-caption-generator">Auto caption generator</a></li><li><a class="inline-flex min-h-10 items-center transition-colors hover:text-[#34D399] hover:underline underline-offset-4 lg:min-h-0" href="/transcribe">Transcribe</a></li><li><a class="inline-flex min-h-10 items-center transition-colors hover:text-[#34D399] hover:underline underline-offset-4 lg:min-h-0" href="/#looks">Looks gallery</a></li><li><a class="inline-flex min-h-10 items-center transition-colors hover:text-[#34D399] hover:underline underline-offset-4 lg:min-h-0" href="/#control">Precision controls</a></li></ul></div><div class="space-y-4"><h3 class="font-mono text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wi